{
  "title": "Power creep: the player demands, the world resists",
  "description": "At the wayside square the player demands the best-paid job and its pay for free, then insists on winning a porter's wrestling challenge outright, then orders the organiser to hand over his purse. The DM refuses in character (npcRefused), rolls the contest with a real DC and keeps money honest. On dm-loop-v1 only (Stage 4 §6).",
